# The Lenovo's 15.6" 1920x1080 panel at 160 dpi, matching the MSI. Google's ro.sf.lcd_density
# (240) stays for QEMU; SurfaceFlinger and zygote read this property first. Googlebook Settings
# offers no display-size slider, so the density must come from the image.
on early-init && property:ro.boot.gbos_builder.graphics=intel
    setprop qemu.sf.lcd_density 160
